      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12983/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strain stock.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/v88Q7wniXU_uwcJMVB-rysY1hV0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12983-basic-chicken-stock-ddmfs-step5-3x4-090f2e52ca244e5cb1c7de89cee1e811.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12983/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Skim fat off the surface.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KZPhp4ZfPbOf_g7m9FyG_YnBQD4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12983-basic-chicken-stock-ddmfs-step6-3x4-df671a97e3b746b989022c99422e0502.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12983/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To clarify stock for clear soup, removing solid flecks that are too small to be strained out with cheesecloth, follow this method: Separate egg white from egg yolk and reserve the shell.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LCEUc7eaok_USBX0VqhTdzSNIwA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12983-basic-chicken-stock-ddmfs-step7-3x4-a7b2ab808bff43faae686e2352899965.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12983/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine 1/4 cup cold water, egg white, and crushed eggshell in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aF3ZD6pkkz8SCtOi7f4OlZ_lF-E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12983-basic-chicken-stock-ddmfs-step8-3x4-397bb3f857204c22847346080fdfa939.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12983/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add to strained stock and bring to a boil. Remove from heat and let stand for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YdLZmiizHhkyhPn2upGQTY14NDY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12983-basic-chicken-stock-ddmfs-step9-3x4-0251b56937aa4e459e9d31a31b3ea97f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12983/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strain again through a sieve lined with cheesecloth.",
